extends RefCounted
## Main NPC line pools: 10 contexts x 4 lines = 40 each. Line id = "<context>_<n>".
## Contexts: greet farewell rich broke ugly sharp died boss idle buy
## The game picks the context from the player's state (see voice_lines.gd pick()).
## Story: Rico climbs five casinos (Atlantic Shitty -> Bellagiro) to win back his
## brother Jules from The House. Dark comedy; punchline last.

const POOLS := {
	"vera": {
		"greet": ["Look who crawled back to my table. Mind the carpet, it's seen things.", "Sit, sugar. The cards are warm and your odds are not.", "Back for charms? Of course. Nobody comes here for my personality.", "I was just thinking about you. Mostly about your wallet. Mostly its funeral."],
		"farewell": ["Go on. Lose gracefully. Or lose loudly, it's better for tips.", "Come back with something shiny. Or someone's teeth. I'm not picky.", "Climb safe. I mean that. You're my only repeat customer.", "Don't die. It's bad for my numbers. And mildly sad."],
		"rich": ["That's a heavy pocket. Let me help you with it. It's what I do.", "Money like that makes my charms blush. They've never seen a wallet that thick.", "You're glowing, sugar. That's either gold or a medical issue.", "Rich suits you. Poor suited you better. Poor was honest."],
		"broke": ["Empty pockets. I can sell you hope. Wholesale. Nonrefundable.", "Aw. Sit. Look at the charms. Looking's free. Everything else is a felony.", "You're broke, not dead. Yet. Those are two separate payment plans.", "Come back when you've robbed someone. Someone rich. I have standards."],
		"ugly": ["Honey, what are you wearing? Blink twice if it's a hostage situation.", "That outfit is a cry for help. In a language nobody speaks.", "Even the slot machines looked away. And they have no eyes.", "Silas will have a stroke. I'll sell tickets. Front row."],
		"sharp": ["Now THAT is how you dress for a loss. Beautiful. Doomed. Fitted.", "Look at you. Dapper doom, with pockets.", "You clean up nice, sugar. Try not to bleed on it. Try.", "If you die in that, at least it's an open casket with taste."],
		"died": ["You died. Again. It's becoming a hobby. A bad one, but yours.", "I saw it. Everyone saw it. The cat saw it and left the room.", "Dust off, sugar. Jules is still up there and you're still down here.", "That was a bold way to lose. Not smart. Bold. We'll call it bold."],
		"boss": ["You beat a boss! I'll remember that when you owe me. Which is soon.", "Impressive. Terrifying, but impressive. Mostly terrifying.", "Another table down. Those people had friends. Mean, wealthy friends.", "Sit. Let me price that victory. It's worth a lot. To me. To you, nothing, ha."],
		"idle": ["Charms don't pick themselves. They pick pockets. Same thing.", "I know a secret. It costs extra. So does the silence.", "Everybody's got a tell. Yours is hope. It's disgusting.", "Cards, charms, chaos. Pick two. You've picked all three. Twice."],
		"buy": ["Wise choice. Or a terrible one. Same fee either way.", "Take it. It likes you. It likes everyone. It's a charm. Attention-seeking is the job.", "That one bites, sugar. In a good way. Mostly.", "Pleasure doing business. Mostly mine. All mine, actually."]},
	"fizz": {
		"greet": ["Psst. Hey. You. Want a pick-me-up? Side effects include being picked up. By paramedics.", "Quiet. Come closer. Closer. NOT that close. Ugh, you breathe a lot.", "Welcome to the pharmacy. We're not licensed. We're barely lichen.", "Finally. A customer. Or a cop. Are you a cop? Blink if you're a cop. Don't blink."],
		"farewell": ["Don't tell anyone. Especially me. I've already forgotten.", "Side effects begin immediately. And permanently. And, rarely, in French.", "Go! Run! Be amazing! Or dead! Statistically it's dead!", "Keep the bottle. I don't want it back. It's looking at me."],
		"rich": ["Oh, you're LOADED. I have the GOOD stuff. It's in the other, worse bag.", "Cash! Real cash! My favorite flavor! Tastes like a lawyer!", "For you, double price, triple effect, quadruple lawsuit.", "Hide that money. Spend it HERE. Where it's safe from your future."],
		"broke": ["No cash? I accept organs. Small ones. Spares. You've got spares, right?", "Broke? Free sample! Free as in 'my liability is now your liability.'", "I trust you. I'll bill your family. Do you have a family? They do now: me.", "Come back when you've been mugged by someone richer than you. Aim high."],
		"ugly": ["That outfit? It's already a hallucination. I haven't even sold you anything.", "You look like a warning label. In a good font, though.", "Don't worry, the drugs make it look better. The drugs make EVERYTHING look better. Even me.", "I've seen better fits on a cadaver. And that cadaver was DEAD."],
		"sharp": ["Fancy! The stuff will clash with your suit. Beautifully. Violently.", "Look at you. A well-dressed mistake. My favorite kind.", "You're too nice for this stall. Buy something. Get less nice.", "Sharp! Let's ruin it. With science. And bile."],
		"died": ["You look dead. Great sign. Means the product works. Try this.", "I heard the scream. Was it you? It was you. Good lungs. Really, great lungs.", "Death's not so bad. Mostly it's the sequel that's worse. I've seen the sequel. Don't see the sequel.", "Don't die near the merchandise. The insurance covers nothing. Literally nothing."],
		"boss": ["A boss! Down! Give me your blood for science. Just a pint. Okay, a gallon.", "You killed someone big? Buy something to celebrate. Their leftovers are in the red bottle.", "Bosses are just customers who never learned to share. I sold that one his last drink.", "Did he have a pulse? A tooth? A kidney? Asking for... business. Not for the business."],
		"idle": ["I have a bottle that sings. It's a bad singer. It's mostly a scream.", "Everything has side effects. Even oxygen. Ask anyone who's died.", "Don't read the label. The label is lying. The label is also a bit of a coward.", "Tell me your symptoms. Then ignore my advice. That's the process. That's the whole process."],
		"buy": ["Drink it fast. No, SLOW. Wait. FAST. Whichever one you didn't do.", "Side effects include luck, death, and a strong opinion about jazz.", "Do not mix with anything. I mean it. Mix it. I'm joking. Mix it.", "A good choice! Probably! I don't read. I just pour and pray."]},
	"tailor": {
		"greet": ["Do come in. Mind the pins. And the mannequins, they bite when ignored.", "Ah. A customer. Or a stray. Hold still, I shall find out which.", "Silas Stitch, at your service. And at your waistline. Good heavens, there's a lot of it.", "Good heavens. Sit down before you offend the mannequins. They have feelings. Sadly, no opinions on you."],
		"farewell": ["Wear it well. Or wear it. Anything. Please do not carry it.", "Mind the hem on the way out. And the door. And your life choices.", "Do try not to bleed on the silk. Or the wool. Or me.", "Come back for a fitting. And a lecture. I've prepared the lecture. It's forty minutes."],
		"rich": ["Splendid. A gentleman with means. Let us begin the long lie that you have taste.", "Ah, the pockets are heavy. The hems shall be lovely. I'll bill you for both.", "With that fortune, we might fix your posture. Surgery is also an option.", "Money! How delightfully vulgar. Please, spend it. On me. Beautifully."],
		"broke": ["No funds? Then we tailor in imagination. Imagine a very nice belt. There. That's two dollars.", "I can give you a very nice belt of regret. It's free. It's itchy.", "Poverty is just fashion in beta. And you've been in beta for years.", "Come back when you can afford sleeves. Until then, you're a vest. A tragic vest."],
		"ugly": ["Dear boy, did you dress in a dumpster? Don't answer. The smell has answered.", "That fanny pack is a war crime. I'd testify.", "I will not say what I think. I will faint. Watch. There. I'm up. Ugh.", "You look like a rumor of an outfit. And the rumor is bad."],
		"sharp": ["Now THAT is a proper silhouette. A murder suspect, but a dapper one.", "Magnificent. I'd put it in a museum. Next to the ones that died in it.", "You are a credit to the craft. And my commission.", "I made half of that. The other half is you. Barely. Squint."],
		"died": ["You died in my wares? Did it stain? Please say it didn't stain.", "A dead client is a quiet client. A bloody client is a lawsuit.", "Do bleed on the old stock, please. Not the new silk. NOT the silk.", "Hold still. I'll repair the holes. Which ones are bullet holes and which are style? Don't tell me."],
		"boss": ["Defeated a boss? Marvelous! Armor, then. Fashionable armor. Is there another kind?", "Slaying monsters in silk. Delightful. Stains come out with lemon, wine, and prayer.", "The trophies will need a tasteful frame. And a priest.", "I made that boss a suit. He hated it. He's dead now, so it's a little better."],
		"idle": ["Gloves for gripping. Boots for smashing. Scarves for gliding. Hats for nothing, I just like hats.", "The shoes make the man. The man makes the dash. The dash makes my rent.", "Stand straight. The cloth knows. The cloth is judging your spine.", "Everything I sell grants a talent. Mostly vanity. Sometimes a double jump."],
		"buy": ["A fine choice. I knew it'd suit you. I say that to everyone. It's never true.", "Wear it with confidence. Or at least shoes. Shoes are the minimum.", "I shall tell the thread you said hello. The thread has opinions.", "One moment. The pins are my pride. And my weapons."]},
	"gunny": {
		"greet": ["Welcome to the armory, recruit. Spit out the gum. And the teeth. Whatever that is.", "Stand up straight! That's a weapon you're holding. Your face. Terrifying. For the wrong reasons.", "Rack 'em and stack 'em, gamblers! Anything that goes bang, we have! Anything that goes whimper, that's you.", "You need firepower. I can smell it. And a shower. I can smell that too."],
		"farewell": ["Don't shoot your foot. Shoot THEIRS. It's a different foot. Concentrate.", "Dismissed. Try to die forward. Dying backward is how you lose the deposit.", "Clean your guns. Wash your hands. Never your lucky socks. They're load-bearing.", "Move out, rookie. And don't bet the ammo. I know you. I KNOW you."],
		"rich": ["Cash! The universal caliber!", "A big spender! I salute your wallet. And your wallet's tiny spine.", "Now THAT is purchasing power. Also, the power of someone with no plan.", "I'll throw in a free ammo clip. And a salute. And a hug. No. Not the hug. Not the hug."],
		"broke": ["No money, no bang. It's simple. It's also the plot of your life.", "Broke? Throw rocks. It's a classic. Rocks have a perfect safety record. Mostly.", "A recruit with no cash. It's a start. It's also a funeral.", "I'm not a charity. I'm a battle store. The difference is the screaming."],
		"ugly": ["Soldier, that outfit is a disciplinary action. And a warcrime. And a Tuesday.", "Camouflage? You look like a bruise. A sad, wandering bruise.", "I've seen better uniforms on a scarecrow. Scarecrow had a better stance, too.", "What happened to your pants, recruit? Did you lose them to the House? Did the House want them?"],
		"sharp": ["Spit-shined! I'm almost proud. I'm also a little emotional. Moving on!", "That suit says 'I'm lethal in four languages.' Shame you only speak panic.", "You look like a general. Behave like one. Send others to die. It's the job.", "A sharp dresser holds a gun better. A dead one holds it worst."],
		"died": ["You're dead? Walk it off! Or crawl it off! Either way, off!", "That's what the armor's for, rookie. You forgot the armor. You always forget the armor.", "Retrain. Rearm. Resurrect. Repeat. That's the whole military. And your whole career.", "The only bad death is the unarmed one. Yours was the second kind."],
		"boss": ["A boss down! Medals for everyone! Except the boss! He gets a closed casket!", "That's the kind of firepower I like! Large, loud, and legally ambiguous!", "I sold that boss his first revolver. I regret nothing. I regret his trigger discipline.", "You make me proud. Don't make it weird. Too late. It's weird."],
		"idle": ["Chip flick. Card fan. Dice bomb. Pick one. Pick all. Pick a fight.", "A revolver has six reasons. Use five. Save one for the barista.", "Coin shotgun's the favorite. Don't ask why. It's illegal in four countries and a Pizza Hut.", "Weapons don't kill people. Bad odds do. And pointy things. And Gary."],
		"buy": ["Excellent! Point it away from yourself! And me! And the cat!", "That's a classic. Respect it. It's seen things. Mostly foreheads.", "Eight out of ten customers survive. Not you. You're a nine. Of ten. Out of eight.", "Good choice, recruit. It kicks. Mostly the person holding it. Hold it tighter."]},
	"lucky": {
		"greet": ["Pull up a stool, runner. Mind the one with the stain. It's fond of you.", "The usual? Whatever that was. You never finish your sentences.", "Lucky's. We don't water it down. Much. We definitely don't change the ice.", "Good to see you breathing. I had you at even money for 'not.'"],
		"farewell": ["Drink responsibly. Or at least first. That's the whole policy.", "Come back in one piece. Two pieces. I'm not picky, I have a mop.", "I'll keep your seat warm. And your tab open. It's the only thing that never closes.", "Break a leg. Not your own. Someone else's. Nicer."],
		"rich": ["First round's on me. Second on you. And your fortune. And your remaining dignity.", "That's a lot of green. I've a Scotch that'll cry. A good cry. It's earned it.", "Cash like that needs a toast. And an alibi.", "You're buying, aren't you. It's not a question. I'm getting the glasses."],
		"broke": ["Tab's on me. Don't make it a habit. Make it a hobby. A small one.", "I'll pour you water. It's all I've got that's free. It's also all I've got that's honest.", "Broke? Join the club. I'm the president. Dues are one drink. Per sorrow.", "Not a problem. Sit. Cry. Hydrate. The tears are on the house."],
		"ugly": ["That outfit's strong. Like my worst whiskey. And you smell similar.", "Not my business what you wear. It's my business that it hurts.", "I've seen better coats in the lost and found. The coats were also on fire.", "A drink might help. Or at least blur it. For both of us."],
		"sharp": ["Look at you. All class and no chaser. Wait, I have chasers. Oh good.", "Dressed to kill. Or at least be killed in. It's a good look either way.", "That suit deserves a good Scotch. You deserve a cheap one. Fair?", "You almost look like you belong here. Don't worry. A drink will fix that."],
		"died": ["Ah, you died. Have a drink. It helps. It doesn't, but it's something to do with your hands.", "Rough one. I'll keep the stool warm. And the bleach handy.", "I've buried better drunks than you. And worse. Mostly worse. Mostly me.", "A drink can save your life, runner. A second can end it. A third is the Marker."],
		"boss": ["You beat a boss? The next round's mine. And the one after. And the funeral.", "Cheers to the one that fell! May he rest, and may his tab be forgiven! It won't be!", "That boss drank here. Tipped badly. Died worse.", "A toast: to the one who didn't die tonight. Tonight being relative."],
		"idle": ["I keep a bar on most floors. Out of spite. And grief. Mostly grief. Spite's a bonus.", "I know a guy who knows a guy. I'm the guy. The other guy is also me.", "A drink never lies. Only the drinker does. And the bartender. Ask me about the bartender.", "Wipe the glass. Listen. That's the whole job. Also, apologize. Constantly."],
		"buy": ["Down the hatch. Gently. Like a bad idea.", "That one has a kick. And a story. Neither has an ending.", "Careful. Don't spill your luck. Spill your guts. Different thing.", "On the house. Sort of. I mean, the House won't cover it. It never does."]},
	"mags": {
		"greet": ["Kid. Good. You're on time. I hate late. Late is where the bodies are.", "I was just counting. Your debt. It's lovely. It's grown so much. It has your eyes.", "Sit. No, standing's fine. For now. I'm lenient on the first visit.", "Ah. My favorite investment. And my favorite mistake. Mostly the first one."],
		"farewell": ["Don't make me swim after you. I just did my hair. Well. The scalp.", "I'll see you soon. You'll see me sooner. That's just physics.", "Pay me. Or I'll collect. Ha. No, really. Ha.", "Be careful out there. It would be a waste. Of my time. Mostly of my time."],
		"rich": ["Look at all that. It looks lonely. Let me adopt it.", "A big pot. A bigger interest. A biggest me.", "You can afford to pay me early. You won't. But you can. That's the spirit I love in you: none.", "Money. My favorite chewable. Tastes like retirement."],
		"broke": ["Broke? I'll float you. A shark takes care of its fish. Briefly. Then, dinner.", "Empty pockets. Full of potential. Mine.", "I never judge. I just remember. Every dollar. Every missed call. Every pet name.", "A loan keeps the family together. My family. Yours is optional."],
		"ugly": ["That outfit is a loan officer's nightmare. I want it framed.", "I'd lend you a suit. Interest only. Forever. Look at the cuffs, they're already forever.", "Is that a fanny pack? I'm calling your mother. I'm calling all your mothers.", "I've collected from better dressed corpses. Not by much. They were better dressed by a lot."],
		"sharp": ["Nice suit. It looks expensive. I know whose. It's mine. You're wearing my money.", "Dressed to impress? I'm impressed. Pay up.", "That's a lot of money on your back. I'll take a cut. Of the back.", "Now you look like a lender. Good news: you're not. Better news: neither am I. I'm a relationship."],
		"died": ["You died. I'm adding that to the interest. Death's a surcharge.", "No refunds in the afterlife. I'd know. I've got a branch there.", "Dead men don't pay. But they do borrow. I've seen it. It's a whole thing.", "Death is just a late payment. Of a different sort. Both lead to me."],
		"boss": ["A boss? Their debt belongs to me now. Their dog too. I don't want the dog.", "Take your spoils. I take my share. We call it a share. The law calls it something else.", "Winning's expensive. Let me carry it. In my teeth.", "You beat the boss. Now beat the interest. Good luck. Nobody has. Not even me."],
		"idle": ["Don't think of it as debt, sweetie. Think of it as a relationship.", "I like you. That's the problem. I like everything I eat.", "Everybody owes somebody. I just own the paperwork. And the walls. And the floor.", "I swim every day. Just in case. In case of you."],
		"buy": ["Sign here. And here. And... there. Don't read it. Nobody reads it. Nobody lives.", "A pleasure. I'll bill you later. And later. And now, actually. Now I billed you.", "Smart. Debt is just future money you spent early. Think of it as time travel with teeth.", "No refunds. No regrets. Some regrets. Almost all regrets. They're yours."]},
	"marlow": {
		"greet": ["Rico. You picked up. Good. I had a bet going. I lost. Good.", "Marlow here. Talk fast, the line's got ears. And mold. Mostly mold.", "Back already? I was just worrying. Constructively. With snacks.", "Hey. You alive? Say something stupid. There. Alive."],
		"farewell": ["Stay alive. Stay lucky. Stay on the line. Pick any two. Never three.", "Call if you need me. Call if you don't. I'm lonely. That's classified.", "Don't do anything I'd worry about. Too late. I'm already composing the eulogy.", "Let it ride, kid. Preferably into a wall that's padded."],
		"rich": ["Look at that pot. Resist the urge. Resist it. Resist it. You didn't resist it.", "You're rich. Don't tell the House. Don't tell yourself, either.", "Bank it, Rico. Please. Bank it. I'm begging. I'm on the floor. That's a dust bunny.", "I've seen guys lose that in one hand. I've also been one of them."],
		"broke": ["Broke again? That's the third time today. And it's lunch.", "Hey. It's money. It comes back. Mostly. Maybe. Look, it's a hope, not a promise.", "I'll cover dinner. Just don't tell your brother. He still thinks I'm solvent.", "You're not broke. You're liquid. In a sad way. Like a puddle."],
		"ugly": ["What are you wearing? I can hear it. It's whispering 'help.'", "Is that a fanny pack? On the phone? I can SEE it. Don't ask how.", "Look, style isn't everything. It's most things. It's, like, 80%.", "Please. Go see Silas. For my sake. I can't unsee it and I'm on a payphone."],
		"sharp": ["Hey, nice suit. I can hear the starch. It's screaming 'don't bleed.'", "You look like a man with a plan. Do you have a plan? Blink twice if no. You can't blink. It's a phone.", "Dressed to kill. Try not to be killed. It's a fine line and your tailor knows it.", "Nice threads. Don't get blood on 'em. I charged a lot of favors for those."],
		"died": ["Rico. Again? We have to stop meeting like this. In a morgue. Via payphone.", "I heard the thud. It was a loud one. I clapped. Don't judge me.", "You died. I'll light a candle. A small one. A very small one. It's a matchstick.", "Good news, Rico: you're alive. Bad news: it's me, and the phone, and Jules is still missing."],
		"boss": ["A boss! I'm updating my bet. I'm betting you survive. A first.", "That's one more casino down. Jules is a little closer. Or a little farther. I'm still checking the map.", "You did it. Don't let it go to your head. Let it go to your knees. Then bank.", "I'm proud. I hate that. I'm checking my pulse."],
		"idle": ["Five casinos. Twenty-five floors. Jules at the top of the Bellagiro. Easy. By which I mean impossible. In order.", "Secrets everywhere. Walls that break. Doors that don't exist. Like my career.", "Follow the light. It leads somewhere. Hopefully not a morgue.", "Every floor has a story. Some bleed. Most are about you losing."],
		"buy": ["Good call. Not great. Good. Like 'good' on a report card for a goldfish.", "I hope you read the fine print. There's no fine print. That's the fine print.", "I wouldn't. But I'm not you. Thank God. Thank all of the gods.", "That's the one Jules would've bought. And look where that got him."]},
	"jules": {
		"greet": ["Rico? Is it really you? I've had that hallucination before. He's usually taller.", "I knew you'd come. I just didn't know when. I did bet on 'never,' though.", "One more hand. Just one. Oh. It's you. You can have the hand.", "Is it morning? What day is it? Is there a day? Who has the clock?"],
		"farewell": ["Don't wait for me. Go. I'm busy being a cautionary tale.", "Say hi to Mom. Or don't. She'll worry. Then she'll ask for the money back.", "Take the money. Leave the cards. And the dice. And the chair. I'm attached to the chair.", "Come back. I'll be here. I'm always here. It's, like, a whole problem."],
		"rich": ["That's a lot of chips. I know the feeling. Don't trust it. It's a lie told by a sparkly liar.", "I had that much once. For ten minutes. Then I had a dealer's smile.", "Bank it. I'm begging. I'm not above begging. I'm below it. Watch.", "I was rich once. It didn't help. It just changed how I lost."],
		"broke": ["Broke? Welcome. It's cozy. The walls are close and the rent is nothing.", "I've been broke for three years. It's fine. I have a lot of hobbies. Mostly regret.", "It's just money. It was never ours. It was the House's. Look at the logo.", "At least we're broke together. That's called family. Or a pyramid scheme."],
		"ugly": ["Nice outfit. I love it. I'm lying. I'm so lying.", "I'd say something. But you're my brother. I'd just say it more quietly.", "You look like me. After three years. And one stain. Is that mine?", "Mom would cry. Then laugh. Then ask where you got it. Then cry again."],
		"sharp": ["You look great. Suspiciously great. Who died? Is it me? Is it me?", "Look at you. Dad would be proud. Dad would also ask where you stole it.", "I used to dress like that. Before. Now I dress like 'before.'", "Did you buy that with my debts? It's got my fingerprints. And my interest."],
		"died": ["You died? Welcome to my life. It's less dead than you'd think. More dead than I'd like.", "It doesn't hurt after the first twenty. Then it's just administrative.", "I've died here a hundred times. You get used to it. And the lighting.", "Get up, Rico. It's just money. And a body. And a soul. And a deposit."],
		"boss": ["You beat a boss? I never got past the third. Or did. They blur together. Like all my mistakes.", "I heard the table go quiet. It was you. Or the building collapsing. Both are fine.", "The House is going to notice. It notices everything. It noticed me twice.", "I'm proud. And scared. And a little jealous. Mostly jealous. Win more, loser."],
		"idle": ["The cards remember everything. Especially the bad ones. Especially me.", "You hear that? The wheel. It never stops. It also never says sorry.", "I counted every floor. There's more. Always more. It's a growing business.", "Be careful with the House. It's not a person. It's a vibe with lawyers."],
		"buy": ["Good pick. I'd have picked it too. I lost anyway. Eventually, with style.", "Take my advice: don't. Take my advice again: don't. You're not listening. Brother.", "It might work. Mine didn't. But I'm an optimist. By which I mean broke.", "At least you're trying. That's what I said. Right before the funeral."]},
	"rico": {
		"greet": ["Let's see what the House has left. Besides my brother. And my dignity.", "Aces up. Brains down. Perfect. That's the whole strategy.", "Another day, another dollar I don't have. And will never have. Hey, momentum.", "Let it ride, baby! Or let it flop. I'm indifferent. I'm lying. LET IT RIDE."],
		"farewell": ["Wish me luck. Not that I need it. I need it so much. Please.", "See you at the top of the Bellagiro. Or the bottom of a dumpster. Same energy.", "I'll be rich by dinner. Or dead. Honestly? Both are on the menu.", "Let it ride! And if it doesn't, let it die! Dramatically!"],
		"rich": ["I'm RICH! Wait. Let me count again. I'm RICH! Wait. That's one chip. Fine. Still RICH!", "Look at all this! I'll bet it. All of it. It's the only responsible thing.", "Money? That's just ammunition. For the House. They're armed with my debts.", "Pot's fat. Time to make it fatter. And then lose it. For balance."],
		"broke": ["Broke? That's just a free roll. With a funeral. Same thing.", "Zero dollars. Infinite possibilities. Mostly bad ones. Mostly involving a pawn shop.", "I've been broker. I'm fine. I'm fine. I'm fine. Does this look fine? Don't answer.", "Rock bottom's got a nice view. Of other, deeper bottoms."],
		"ugly": ["I look like a dumpster fire and I LOVE it. Fire's warm. Dumpsters are home.", "Is this fanny pack lucky? It's lucky. It's lucky. Please be lucky.", "Style is for people with odds. I have vibes. And a belt of regret.", "Somebody call a stylist. Or a priest. Or an exorcist. A stylist who is also an exorcist."],
		"sharp": ["I look incredible. The House should be scared. The House should also be on a payment plan.", "Dressed to kill. Or at least to lose in style. Style is the only thing I keep.", "Hey, I clean up nice. I mean it. Don't look at the shoes. The shoes are in debt.", "Would you bet on me? I would. I do. I did. That's the whole problem."],
		"died": ["Okay. That one was on me. The one before that was on a wall. Fine.", "Death? Barely noticed. I do it for a living. A bad one. A living-ish one.", "I'll do it differently next time. Or exactly the same. Variety is overrated.", "I regret nothing. Except that. And the thing before. And the entire year."],
		"boss": ["Read 'em and weep, pal! You're weeping already. Good. Good for you.", "Another table down. Another reason to gamble! I mean, ANOTHER reason. The first was my entire personality.", "I called the bluff. And the bluff folded. And then it cried. Which was unprofessional.", "Who's next? Don't answer. I don't want to know. Okay, answer."],
		"idle": ["Odds are for people who don't have a gun. Or a plan. Or a savings.", "I once bet my shoes. Won. Lost the shoes. Same thing. Zero net shoes.", "Risk is just fun with consequences. And a rash. Mostly the rash.", "Climb five casinos, get Jules, don't bet him. Three steps. I've only failed step three. In theory."],
